        {
          "text": " Kosodete koyanaasi Yeremia, kocakakis aipany naka Malikiya okoku loka ekabaka, naajai alaro naka ikedarak: kijoliliosi Yeremia kaunoi, Amameete akip kotoma aipany, dimarai erit: kiliko erit Yeremia.",
          "type": "text",
