          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekajakait ekabaka, eswamata ituŋa lu nueroko kakere nueswamakis Yeremia enabi, Ioacakakis aipany; ido ekot arwanikin aibois neejai kanuka eteŋei; naarai emameete inyamat kore.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosodi ekabaka aicorakin Ebed-melek Etiopiat, kobala ebe, “Koyaŋa kane ituŋa akaisauni, kouparos kakes, kolemutu Yeremia enabi kaipany, eroko ketwana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosodi Ebed-melek koyana Innja, kouparos kakes, koloma togo loka ekabaka kwap kainadis, kolem inyakinyakia lumoion luaeakaritai, ka idapaiea, kisijolilio kaunoi aipany mama ejai Yeremia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
