        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodi kotema Ebed-melek Etiopiat Yeremia ariar, “Kibwaik inyakinyakia lu lumoion luaeakaritai ka idapaiea lu akirididinikon kanuka aunoi.” Kiswama Yeremia kwaŋin, ",
