        },
        {
          "text": "Kosodi kijuka Sedekia ekabaka, koyaunai Yeremia enabi mamake alomaret nakiwuniet naejai togo loka EJAKAIT. Kotema ekabaka Yeremia atiar, “Keenit akirot; sirikimunonik adiokirot kere.” ",
